      "writtenOn": "2026-11-26T11:05:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. I added a class-scoped jaxrs_restconf_endpoint fixture in the root conftest.py that installs odl-restconf-nb-jaxrs only if it isn\u0027t already installed. In that case it registers a finalizer before the install that uninstalls it again, and it leaves a preinstalled feature alone, since something else put it there. suite_setup depends on the fixture, so the Shiro configuration is restored over JAX-RS before JAX-RS is uninstalled.",
